From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jerry Zhao <jerryz123@berkeley.edu>
Subject: [PATCH] Recognize augmented hypervisor profile properties
Purpose: Accepts Sha and its opcode-free guarantees while enabling H and state-enable execution.
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

The pinned implementation already supplies these H architectural guarantees.
Ssstateen selects the existing complete Smstateen implementation. No instruction
or CSR behavior is replaced by this parser extension.

diff --git a/disasm/isa_parser.cc b/disasm/isa_parser.cc
--- a/disasm/isa_parser.cc
+++ b/disasm/isa_parser.cc
@@ -94,2 +94,10 @@ static const extension_info_t extension_infos[] = {
   {"h", {'H'}},
+  {"sha", {}, {"h", "ssstateen", "shcounterenw", "shvstvala", "shtvala", "shvstvecd", "shvsatpa", "shgatpa"}},
+  {"ssstateen", {}, {"smstateen"}},
+  {"shcounterenw"},
+  {"shvstvala"},
+  {"shtvala"},
+  {"shvstvecd"},
+  {"shvsatpa"},
+  {"shgatpa"},
   {"zfh", {EXT_ZFH}, {"zfhmin"}},
